Steps:
[AUTH] POST {{BACK_URL}}/connect/token (grant_type=password, username={{ADMIN_EMAIL}}, password={{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}) to obtain an admin Bearer token
[HTTP] GET {{BACK_URL}}/api/platform/settings/v2/tenant/Store/schema with the admin token - capture the first Boolean or ShortText Store setting as store_setting, BLOCKED (not FAIL) if none exists
[HTTP] GET settings/v2/global/values, tenant/Store/{{STORE_ID}}/values and me/values - capture originals
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/platform/settings/v2/global/values {global_setting: original + 1}
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/platform/settings/v2/tenant/Store/{{STORE_ID}}/values {store_setting: store_new_value}
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/api/platform/settings/v2/me/values {me_setting: flipped}
[HTTP] read each back through GET {{BACK_URL}}/api/platform/settings/<name> (v1) and GET settings/v2/<scope>/values
[ADMIN] open the Settings blade (global) and the store Settings widget and read the displayed values
[HTTP] POST each setting back to its captured non-null original

